<section id="security">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec">
      <div><h3>FTC Safeguards Rule</h3><p>Most dealers that finance or lease fall under the Safeguards Rule, including obligations around service providers who touch customer information. We work inside your program: NDA, data-processing terms, least-privilege access, MFA, encryption in transit and at rest, retention and deletion procedures, and an incident-response process.</p></div>
      <div><h3>TCPA and AI voice</h3><p>The FCC has confirmed that TCPA restrictions on artificial and prerecorded voices cover AI-generated voices in covered outbound calls, with consent requirements attached. We will not stand up an AI calling or texting program simply because the technology works. Consent handling is part of the build.</p></div>
      <div><h3>No real customer data in development</h3><p>Prototypes and test environments run on synthetic data. No SSNs, no credit applications, no financial information, ever, in anything that isn't production.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Humans stay in the loop</h3><p>Every workflow we design has defined approval points and escalation rules. Your people decide where the system is allowed to act on its own and where it has to stop and ask.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

